      "description": "Example Product helps you plan focused days with clear priorities, smart reminders, and calm progress tracking.\n\nKey features:\n- Plan tasks by energy and deadline\n- See your next best action instantly\n- Track routines without noisy streak pressure\n- Unlock Pro for recurring plans and advanced insights\n\nSUBSCRIPTION INFORMATION:\nExample Product Pro unlocks recurring plans, advanced insights, and unlimited routines. Subscription options include a 14-day free trial for eligible new subscribers plus weekly, monthly, and yearly auto-renewable plans. Payment will be charged to your Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase or after the free trial ends, where applicable. Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Your Apple ID account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage or cancel subscriptions any time in your App Store account settings.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://example.com/privacy\nTerms of Use: https://example.com/terms",
